{"2861590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Machine Mind", "steam_appid": 2861590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4282690, 4282980], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/95f5635213af7bd3057f2d7a96360529.poster.avif?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/95f5635213af7bd3057f2d7a96360529.webm?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/95f5635213af7bd3057f2d7a96360529.mp4?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world survived a nuclear war after a mysterious virus swept the planet and wiped out most of the humanity. Some managed to find refuge in an orbital station, and Earth has become a wasteland ruled by mad raiders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your ship crashed, your personality was preserved in a special consciousness module thanks to an experimental programme, but you remain a prisoner of the metal shell. Use the rovers to survive, reconnect with the orbital station, and solve the mysteries of the catastrophe that changed everything.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/df19ab83b4d8c17ca2da7dcfc5487889.webp?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/e1db7b237839f024eed0e6387f369068.poster.avif?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/e1db7b237839f024eed0e6387f369068.webm?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/e1db7b237839f024eed0e6387f369068.mp4?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make weapons, modules and equipment from the resources you gather to upgrade your machines and fortify your base. Build and modify rovers with the help of various modules that you can adapt for different tasks, from mining to fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/f250bbf9633754b19b017029339740dc.webp?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/916a3351238ca2e0ffa20109dea9a5ff.poster.avif?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/916a3351238ca2e0ffa20109dea9a5ff.webm?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/916a3351238ca2e0ffa20109dea9a5ff.mp4?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconstruct destroyed bases, build defences and structures to survive in dangerous conditions, engage in intense battles with raiders and bosses using advanced weapons and combat modules, and be ready for the challenges of nature: you’ll have to deal with disasters such as sandstorms and radiation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/9ab9bf9b63c7e75f870b963c08743b2f.webp?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/839e6e9ec3ddee545ae83553759d4f5a.poster.avif?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/839e6e9ec3ddee545ae83553759d4f5a.webm?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/839e6e9ec3ddee545ae83553759d4f5a.mp4?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign transport rovers to resource gathering, construction, and defence tasks. Plan actions and appoint roles to machines to focus on strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/f82abc96ae90a7bc16cc0979620bead3.webp?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/159fb81a39ebf1dd856212c5f35b68e2.poster.avif?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/159fb81a39ebf1dd856212c5f35b68e2.webm?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/159fb81a39ebf1dd856212c5f35b68e2.mp4?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of locations, from wastelands to abandoned factories, each full of resources, enemies and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/1a6eba52563243a90d5a922cbe93ecad.poster.avif?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=136 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/1a6eba52563243a90d5a922cbe93ecad.webm?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/1a6eba52563243a90d5a922cbe93ecad.mp4?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/95f5635213af7bd3057f2d7a96360529.poster.avif?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/95f5635213af7bd3057f2d7a96360529.webm?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/95f5635213af7bd3057f2d7a96360529.mp4?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world survived a nuclear war after a mysterious virus swept the planet and wiped out most of the humanity. Some managed to find refuge in an orbital station, and Earth has become a wasteland ruled by mad raiders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After your ship crashed, your personality was preserved in a special consciousness module thanks to an experimental programme, but you remain a prisoner of the metal shell. Use the rovers to survive, reconnect with the orbital station, and solve the mysteries of the catastrophe that changed everything.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/df19ab83b4d8c17ca2da7dcfc5487889.webp?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/e1db7b237839f024eed0e6387f369068.poster.avif?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/e1db7b237839f024eed0e6387f369068.webm?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/e1db7b237839f024eed0e6387f369068.mp4?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make weapons, modules and equipment from the resources you gather to upgrade your machines and fortify your base. Build and modify rovers with the help of various modules that you can adapt for different tasks, from mining to fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/f250bbf9633754b19b017029339740dc.webp?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/916a3351238ca2e0ffa20109dea9a5ff.poster.avif?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/916a3351238ca2e0ffa20109dea9a5ff.webm?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/916a3351238ca2e0ffa20109dea9a5ff.mp4?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconstruct destroyed bases, build defences and structures to survive in dangerous conditions, engage in intense battles with raiders and bosses using advanced weapons and combat modules, and be ready for the challenges of nature: you’ll have to deal with disasters such as sandstorms and radiation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/9ab9bf9b63c7e75f870b963c08743b2f.webp?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/839e6e9ec3ddee545ae83553759d4f5a.poster.avif?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/839e6e9ec3ddee545ae83553759d4f5a.webm?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/839e6e9ec3ddee545ae83553759d4f5a.mp4?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign transport rovers to resource gathering, construction, and defence tasks. Plan actions and appoint roles to machines to focus on strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/f82abc96ae90a7bc16cc0979620bead3.webp?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/159fb81a39ebf1dd856212c5f35b68e2.poster.avif?t=1786953927\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2861590/extras/159fb81a39ebf1dd856212c5f35b68e2.webm?t=1786953927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source sr